Z||000011||Alex2004||12-31-2000||04:27 PM||||Well i went outside and turned the A/C on, the fan did not come on. So i guess i'll test the relay. Thanks!!!<P>Alex<P>------------------<BR>   <A HREF="mailto:Alex917@excite.com">Alex917@excite.com</A> ||||reg||1
Z||000012||rogergarrison||12-31-2000||07:21 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Verticalspeed:<BR><B> Is that a MERA that you are driving? Very nice!</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>thanks but its a kit not a Mera. I think one way to tell a Mera is there are no louvers between the headlites. Any Mera owners can tell me if im right. Mine has 4 louvers that run across front of hood over the radiator.<P>||||reg||1
